5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's start by agreeing on what we actually need to investigate before we look at any vendor names.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m mostly worried about the depot floor. Freight doesn’t pause for our meetings, so the system has to fit how we actually work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m tracking the costs that keep arriving after the initial approval. The headline price is a lie; I need to see what the long tail actually costs.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I keep seeing projects fail because nobody owns the mess when things break, or the plan changes too fast. I want to know which trap we’re walking into.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’m watching for systems that quietly age in place and work handed outside that comes back needing repair.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, your point about the long tail is valid. I’m worried about the people who have to maintain it. Who is left to hold it together?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, that long tail worries me too. I’m checking the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial to see if our hardware can even handle the new system.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, the hardware is a symptom. I’m pulling the renewal invoices and the board minutes to see where the money actually goes after the contract is signed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, your point about outside work needing repair is key. I’m checking the 2018 pay move data lift and the winter outage support ownership to see where we lost control.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, the 2018 data lift is a perfect example of that repair cycle. I’m checking the dispatch tool’s upgrade history to see how long we’ve been ignoring maintenance.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, the hardware mix is a real risk, but I’m more concerned about the people. I’m checking the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors to see who’s left to carry this.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, the people are the heart of it. I’m checking the depot calendar and the yard devices to see if the system can survive our peak season.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Misaki, the people are the bottleneck, but the money is the constraint. I’m checking the board minutes and the renewal invoices to see where the budget actually goes.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Misaki, the people are the real risk. I’m checking the warehouse rule changes and the winter outage to see where ownership and scope actually broke down.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the invoices will show the bleed, but the dispatch history shows the rot. I’m checking the upgrade history and the 2018 data lift to see how long we’ve been ignoring the decay.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I’m confirming my two choices: administrator retirements and depot supervisors. Let’s see what we find before we pick a vendor.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m locking in the depot calendar and the yard devices. We need to know if the system can survive our peak season and our actual hardware.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’m locking in the board minutes and the renewal invoices. I need to see where the money actually goes after the contract is signed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m locking in the warehouse rule changes and the winter outage support. I need to see where ownership and scope actually broke down.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’m locking in the dispatch tool’s upgrade history and the 2018 pay move data lift. I need to see how long we’ve been ignoring the decay.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
